# Copy to .github/CODEOWNERS and turn on "Require review from Code Owners" in the branch protection of main.
# The release gate's code ships in the commit it judges: whoever can merge changes to these paths can change what
# PASS means. Keep them owned by the team that owns release quality (replace the placeholder team).
/release/            @your-org/release-owners
/define/             @your-org/release-owners
/evaluate/           @your-org/release-owners
/common/             @your-org/release-owners
/observe/            @your-org/release-owners
/.github/workflows/  @your-org/release-owners
